{"verse_key": "10:88", "surah": 10, "verse": 88, "text_uthmani": "وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّكَ ءَاتَيْتَ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَأَهُۥ زِينَةً وَأَمْوَٰلًا فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا رَبَّنَا لِيُضِلُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِكَ ۖ رَبَّنَا ٱطْمِسْ عَلَىٰٓ أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ وَٱشْدُدْ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَلَا يُؤْمِنُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَلِيمَ", "translation": "And Moses said, \"Our Lord, indeed You have given Pharaoh and his establishment splendor and wealth in the worldly life, our Lord, that they may lead [men] astray from Your way. Our Lord, obliterate their wealth and harden their hearts so that they will not believe until they see the painful punishment.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1903150, "verse_to_ms": 1935490, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَقَالَ", "start_ms": 1903150, "end_ms": 1904250}, {"i": 1, "text": "مُوسَىٰ", "start_ms": 1904250, "end_ms": 1904950}, {"i": 2, "text": "رَبَّنَآ", "start_ms": 1904950, "end_ms": 1907210}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِنَّكَ", "start_ms": 1907210, "end_ms": 1908570}, {"i": 4, "text": "ءَاتَيْتَ", "start_ms": 1908570, "end_ms": 1909450}, {"i": 5, "text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "start_ms": 1909450, "end_ms": 1910450}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَمَلَأَهُۥ", "start_ms": 1910450, "end_ms": 1911510}, {"i": 7, "text": "زِينَةً", "start_ms": 1911510, "end_ms": 1913040}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَأَمْوَٰلًا", "start_ms": 1913040, "end_ms": 1914630}, {"i": 9, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1914630, "end_ms": 1914930}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "start_ms": 1914930, "end_ms": 1915830}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "start_ms": 1915830, "end_ms": 1916870}, {"i": 12, "text": "رَبَّنَا", "start_ms": 1916870, "end_ms": 1917850}, {"i": 13, "text": "لِيُضِلُّوا۟", "start_ms": 1917850, "end_ms": 1918970}, {"i": 14, "text": "عَن", "start_ms": 1918970, "end_ms": 1919730}, {"i": 15, "text": "سَبِيلِكَ", "start_ms": 1919730, "end_ms": 1920860}, {"i": 16, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1920860, "end_m